# i18n Translation Patterns

## Import Type-Safe Translations

```typescript
import { I18nTranslations } from '@core/i18n/generated/i18n.generated';
import { I18n, I18nContext } from 'nestjs-i18n';
```

## Controller - Use @I18n() Decorator

```typescript
async create(
  @Body() dto: CreateDto,
  @I18n() i18n: I18nContext<I18nTranslations>,
  @Res() response: Response
) {
  const result = await this.service.create(dto, i18n);
  const message = i18n.t('users.created'); // Type-safe key
  ResponseHelper.created(result, response, message);
}
```

## Service - Accept i18n as Parameter

```typescript
// ✅ Pass i18n context to service (don't inject)
async create(
  dto: CreateDto,
  i18n: I18nContext<I18nTranslations>
): Promise<UserResponse> {
  const message = i18n.t('users.alreadyExists');
  throw ApiException.conflict(message);
}
```

## Translation with Parameters

```typescript
const message = i18n.t('validation.minLength', {
  args: { min: 8 }
});
```

## Translation Files

- Location: `src/core/i18n/locales/en/[module].json`
- Types auto-generated: `src/core/i18n/generated/i18n.generated.ts`
- Regenerate: Run `npm run start:dev` or `npm run build`
